# Editor/agent tooling config, not part of the project.
#
# `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/`: git will not descend into an excluded
# *directory*, so a bare `.claude/` makes the re-includes below unreachable —
# and the obvious repair, adding `!.claude/`, negates the exclusion entirely
# and drags every agent's local config (launch.json, settings.local.json) back
# in. Excluding the contents instead leaves the directory walkable, so the
# re-includes actually apply.
.claude/*
# …except the project skills, which are documentation: they encode subsystem
# invariants the same way ARCHITECTURE.md does, and CLAUDE.md references them.
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**

# Compiled helper, rebuilt on demand.
scripts/.window-id.bin
